      title: "TAD_PushRequest_Architecture.doc",
      snippet: `================================================================================
TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE DOCUMENT (TAD) — PUSH REQUEST TRACKER
Internal DevOps & Deployment Governance Tool — Perum DAMRI
Lead Developer & System Analyst: Andhika Putra Pratama, S.Kom.
Status: IMPLEMENTED & IN PRODUCTION
================================================================================

1. ARSITEKTUR TINGKAT TINGGI (HIGH LEVEL ARCHITECTURE)
   Push Request Tracker dibangun untuk menyatukan audit commit repository GitHub,
   pelacakan status deployment ke server live produksi, dan kanban workflow.
   
   Alur Data:
   [GitHub Enterprise Repo] 
         | (Webhook POST on Push / Release Event)
         v
   [Webhook Controller] (HMAC-SHA256 Signature Verification)
         |
         v
   [Ingestion Queue & Background Worker]
         |
         +--> [GitHub REST API] (Fetch Commit Diff, File Additions / Deletions)
         |
         +--> [PostgreSQL Database] (Audit Trail Storage)
         |
         v
   [Real-Time Kanban UI] (Datatables, Diff Modal, Deploy Approval Gate)

2. DESAIN BASIS DATA UTAMA (DATA ARCHITECTURE)
   - push_notes       : Header event push, repository, branch, author, commit hash.
   - change_logs      : Rincian commit message, author, dan ringkasan fungsional.
   - change_log_files : Rincian nama file, status (added/modified/deleted), lines (+/-).
   - prod_pulls       : Rekam status penarikan kode ke server produksi live.
   - users & roles    : RBAC (Admin TI, Tech Lead, Developer, QA Auditor).

3. FITUR KEAMANAN & KEANDALAN SISTEM
   - HMAC-SHA256 Verification: Memvalidasi header X-Hub-Signature-256 pada setiap event.
   - Idempotency Handling: Menghindari duplikasi log audit saat terjadi webhook retry.
   - Rate Limiting: Melindungi server dari lonjakan traffic push mendadak.

4. HASIL KUANTITATIF & NILAI BISNIS
   - 100% Visibilitas Deployment: Menghilangkan insiden file tertinggal saat rilis.
   - Efisiensi Approval: Tech Lead dapat menginspeksi file diff langsung dari browser XP
     sebelum menyetujui penarikan kode ke server live.`
