      title: "SRS_SeatLock_Engine_v1.0.doc",
      snippet: `================================================================================
SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS SPECIFICATION (SRS) — SEAT LOCK ENGINE
High-Concurrency Reservation, Race Condition & Idempotency Specification
Doc Ref: SRS-RND-SL-2026-001 | Version: 1.0-R&D | Status: DRAFT — R&D LAB
Author / System Analyst: Andhika Putra Pratama, S.Kom.
Domain: High-Throughput Transport & Fleet Reservation Systems
================================================================================

1. EXECUTIVE BUSINESS PROBLEM STATEMENT
   Pada sistem reservasi tiket armada transportasi berskala nasional saat peak season
   (seperti mudik Lebaran atau promo flash sale), lonjakan ribuan pemesanan per detik 
   memicu race condition fatal:
   a. Double-Booking Catastrophe: Dua pengguna berhasil membayar kursi yang persis sama
      karena jeda latensi database relasional (phantom read / non-atomic read-then-write).
   b. Zombie Seat Locks: Kursi dikunci oleh pengguna yang meninggalkan halaman checkout,
      sehingga kursi hangus tanpa ada pembelian riil (lost revenue).
   c. Network Retry Duplication: Koneksi internet seluler yang tidak stabil membuat aplikasi
      mengirimkan ulang request pemesanan, menduplikasi transaksi di payment gateway.

2. SYSTEM SCOPE & CORE MODULES (8 Core Modules)
   [MOD-01] Real-Time Seat Inventory & Topology Matrix
   [MOD-02] Distributed Lock Manager (Redis SETNX + Dynamic TTL)
   [MOD-03] Checkout Orchestrator & State Transition Engine
   [MOD-04] Payment Webhook Ingestion & 3-Way Reconciliation
   [MOD-05] TTL Watchdog & Zombie Key Auto-Eviction
   [MOD-06] Idempotency Registry (UUIDv4 Key De-duplication)
   [MOD-07] Cryptographic Audit Trail & Event Sourcing Ledger
   [MOD-08] Concurrency Telemetry & Capacity Stress Analytics

3. CRITICAL BUSINESS RULES & CONCURRENCY GOVERNANCE
   BR-SL-01 [Plafon Kursi]: Maksimal 4 kursi per akun per sesi transaksi.
   BR-SL-02 [Lock Expiry TTL]: Kunci kursi bersifat sementara dengan TTL tepat 10 menit
            (600 detik). Watchdog wajib melepas lock jika checkout tidak rampung.
   BR-SL-03 [Mandatori Idempotency]: Setiap transaksi wajib menyertakan header Idempotency-Key
            (UUIDv4). Request identik dalam 24 jam wajib mengembalikan response cache 200 OK.
   BR-SL-04 [Penanganan Webhook Terlambat]: Jika notifikasi bayar masuk setelah TTL habis
            dan kursi sudah dibeli orang lain, engine otomatis menerbitkan auto-refund voucher.
   BR-SL-05 [Pessimistic Fallback]: Redis Cluster sebagai primary distributed lock, dengan
            database pessimistic locking (SELECT FOR UPDATE) sebagai secondary consistency guard.
   BR-SL-06 [Audit Trail Immutability]: Setiap event pergantian state (LOCKED, RELEASED,
            BOOKED) wajib ditulis ke event stream yang append-only.

4. DATA DICTIONARY HIGHLIGHTS (seat_locks table)
   - id             : UUID (Primary Key, Cluster Clustered Index)
   - seat_id        : VARCHAR(32) (Foreign Key ke seats.id, Indexed)
   - session_token  : VARCHAR(64) (Kriptografis unik pemegang kunci)
   - locked_at      : TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE (Presisi milidetik)
   - ttl_expires_at : TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE (Evaluasi kedaluwarsa)
   - status         : ENUM('TEMP_LOCKED', 'CHECKOUT', 'BOOKED', 'EXPIRED')
   - idempotency_key: VARCHAR(64) (Unique constraint, 24h retention)

5. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS (NFR) & ARCHITECTURAL BENCHMARKS
   - P99 Lock Acquisition Latency : < 50 milidetik pada beban 10.000 req/detik.
   - Double-Booking Tolerance     : 0.00% (Strict Zero-Tolerance).
   - Redis Memory Footprint       : ~256 bytes per active seat lock key.
   - Failure Mode SLA             : Graceful degradation ke database transaction boundary.`
    }
